/-!
# Ingredients for the marked tensor triality model

The corrected second-axis comparison is NPlus-equivariant, and its standard
vector has the stabilizer specified in 29.7(2). The two literal tensor slots
carry the genuine N1 action, compared with LocalC on every vector. The cyclic
axis transport and gluing into the full three-summand N representation remain
separate construction obligations; this module does not assume an extension.

Source: Aschbacher, *Sporadic Groups*, 29.7, printed pp. 156–157.
-/
